    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/56791b00c22f322cce402b9c280bad72.avif?t=1755270656\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldier, what are you doing here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arm yourself with unique weapons and use combinations of abilities on different levels to survive and destroy hordes of your enemies led by their master, a hideous but very powerful necromancer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight on the levels-arenas, which you will have to pass using unique weapons, from axe to the most powerful blaster - vaporizing everything in its path, as well as various perks that can strengthen you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.poster.avif?t=1755270656\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.webm?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.mp4?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Huge hordes</strong> of enemies will chase you, but only you can fight back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stay alive</strong>. Don't let any of them lay a finger on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The <strong>Powerful weapons</strong> you find will help you in destroying any obstacle encountered on the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Use various abilities</strong> that will help you become faster, stronger and more agile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic music</strong> that will match your intense battles perfectly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this will take place in different locations, from city streets and green parks to unexplored bunkers, where unimaginable monsters hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.poster.avif?t=1755270656\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.webm?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.mp4?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/56791b00c22f322cce402b9c280bad72.avif?t=1755270656\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soldier, what are you doing here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arm yourself with unique weapons and use combinations of abilities on different levels to survive and destroy hordes of your enemies led by their master, a hideous but very powerful necromancer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight on the levels-arenas, which you will have to pass using unique weapons, from axe to the most powerful blaster - vaporizing everything in its path, as well as various perks that can strengthen you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.poster.avif?t=1755270656\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.webm?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/96ea21e48274e34b04b0724fbe6fda25.mp4?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Huge hordes</strong> of enemies will chase you, but only you can fight back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Stay alive</strong>. Don't let any of them lay a finger on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The <strong>Powerful weapons</strong> you find will help you in destroying any obstacle encountered on the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Use various abilities</strong> that will help you become faster, stronger and more agile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic music</strong> that will match your intense battles perfectly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this will take place in different locations, from city streets and green parks to unexplored bunkers, where unimaginable monsters hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.poster.avif?t=1755270656\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.webm?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879200/extras/01b352c1dba7c727f330b820bb6f060a.mp4?t=1755270656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
